{"seq":2,"slug":"economic-moats","title":"经济护城河","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/economic-moats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-moat-concept","title":"护城河概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/economic-moats/the-moat-concept","wordCount":1508,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"quality-over-cheapness","title":"质量重于廉价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/economic-moats/quality-over-cheapness","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"经济护城河\">经济护城河</h1><p>寻找拥有持久竞争优势的企业，是巴菲特投资选择的核心。本章阐释其护城河思想。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;护城河概念&quot;——他如何用这一比喻揭示企业持久竞争优势的本质。第二篇文档讲述&quot;质量重于廉价&quot;,呈现他从&quot;捡便宜&quot;到&quot;买伟大企业&quot;的成熟投资观。</p>\n"}